          </p>
          <p>
            Two numbers rule most mats in or out: your walking pad's footprint, measured across its
            widest points including any wheels or feet, and the clearance between the top of the belt
            and the underside of your desk when the desk is at your walking height. Write both down
            before you read the cards.
          </p>
        </div>
